# ── blast framework — append these patterns to your project's .gitignore ──
#
# These are the patterns blast NEEDS ignored to function correctly.
# They do NOT include generic language/IDE/OS ignores — keep those in your
# own .gitignore per your stack. Drop-in install: append the lines below to
# your existing .gitignore. Fresh-project install via `blast init`: this
# block is copied into your root .gitignore automatically.

# Claude Code — per-machine local settings (never commit)
.claude/settings.local.json

# blast runtime state (per-session, never commit)
.blast/.session-state/
.blast/logs/agent-runs.jsonl

# Personal/private content — paper drafts, R&D, internal notes, spike data.
# Never tracked. Use this dir for anything you want kept local-only.
.priv/

# ── end blast block ──
